#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:170
msgid "The browser console shows errors like “Access to script at '…rocketcdn.me/…/text-to-audio-pro-button.min.js' from origin '…' has been blocked by CORS policy: No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource.” The player never loads."
msgstr "A consola do navegador mostra erros como “Access to script at '…rocketcdn.me/…/text-to-audio-pro-button.min.js' from origin '…' has been blocked by CORS policy: No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource.” O leitor nunca carrega."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:173
msgid "Why this happens:"
msgstr "Porque acontece:"

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: production/text-to-audio/admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
#: src/dashboard/components/dashboard/docs/Docs.js:174
msgid "Your CDN is serving our plugin's JavaScript files, but your origin server isn't sending an Access-Control-Allow-Origin header. CDNs are pull caches — they only return what the origin gives them. When WP Rocket's Delay JavaScript (or a similar optimizer) adds a crossorigin attribute to the script tag, the browser then enforces CORS and blocks the load. This is a server configuration on your site, not a plugin bug."
msgstr "A sua CDN serve os arquivos JavaScript do nosso plugin, mas o seu servidor de origem não envia o cabeçalho Access-Control-Allow-Origin. As CDN são caches do vocêpo pull — só devolvem o que a origem lhes dá. Quando a função Delay JavaScript do WP Rocket (ou um ovocêmizador semelhante) adiciona o atributo crossorigin à evocêqueta script, o navegador aplica o CORS e bloqueia o carregamento. É uma configuração do servidor do seu site, não um erro do plugin."

#: admin/js/build/chunks/tab-docs.2aff582aa4df64b0.chunk.js:2
